# A loft held to a guide curve (roadmap 28.3): the top circle of
# loft_guide_profiles.tlspr lofted to the bottom one, picked with the
# mouse; the cubic of the guide sketch picked and made its guide by New
# Group > Guide Loft by Selected Curves; its screen showing one guide;
# the solid checked; the guide taken away again on the screen; and the
# menu again with nothing selected.
file $testdata/ui/loft_guide_profiles.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view iso
move 252.5 272.5
down L 252.5 272.5
up L 252.5 272.5
menu Features|Loft To Selected Profile
move 337.5 267.5
down L 337.5 267.5
up L 337.5 267.5
menu Features|Guide Loft by Selected Curves
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
twmove 172 225
twdown L 172 225
twup L 172 225
tw
answer ok
menu Features|Guide Loft by Selected Curves
